(footprint "DTM15-12PA"
	(version 20241229)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "9.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "TE Connectivity DEUTSCH DTM15-12PA (key A, grey sleeve), sealed PCB header receptacle, 12 positions, STRAIGHT (180deg) pins, FLANGED panel mount, PCB parallel to the panel; same footprint for DTM15-12PB/PC/PD (keying is in the plastic only: pins, PCB screws and panel screws identical in the four TE STEP models). DEUTSCH size 20 contacts, 7.5 A on 16-20 AWG, 250 V, -55..+125 degC, 20 mating cycles (108-151010); mates DTM06-12S*. Geometry from TE customer drawing C-DTM15-12PX rev B2 (15JUN2026), application spec 114-151047 rev A1 fig. DTM15-12P, cross-checked on TE STEP c-dtm15-12pa-99-3d (pin tails on hole centres, 0.000 mm). PCB layout: 12x D1.30 +/-0.05, pitch 4.191, rows 7.112 apart, centred on the panel cutout; 4x NPTH D3.43 +0.12/-0 for #4-20 screws from under the PCB (34.824 x 25.400). Seating plane on the PCB; flange underside 4.19, flange front (panel seat) 17.27 above the PCB (seal crest 17.78), nose top 30.23; pins 3.05 below. Panel cutout option 2 on Dwgs.User: 41.28 (screw axis) x 21.49, 4x R3.18, 2x D4.06 on 49.53 for #6-19 screws, flat seal land >= 60.96 x 33.02, panel 6.25 max. Seen from the component side (= drawing front view), keyway A down: row 1-6 left to right at the top, row 12-7 below. If the fab NPTH tolerance is symmetric, order 3.45-3.50. https://www.te.com/en/product-DTM15-12PA.html")
	(tags "connector DEUTSCH DTM DTM15 12 pin position straight vertical 180deg flange panel mount sealed automotive TE size 20 7.5A header receptacle")
